OL,3,A'Wear more clothes if it's cold,'
OL,4,Aschools told as energy bills rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff and pupils at schools across
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland have been told to
OL,8,F"wear more clothes" if it is cold in
OL,9,Forder to cut heating bills.
OL,11,FSchools have been told by the Education
OL,12,FAuthority (EA) to reduce heating and
OL,13,Flighting "wherever possible".
OL,15,FThe authority has said that school gas
OL,16,Fand electricity bills are set to rise
OL,17,Fby about #8m by March 2027.
OL,19,FThe EA has written to school heads
OL,20,Fwarning that increasing costs will
OL,21,Faffect school energy bills.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
